            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "\"I secured third position in the Federal Public Service Commission examination and have been appointed as a principal (BS-18) in Rahimabad Gilgit, shared Sajjad Khan, a graduate of our MPhil in Education programme.  \"The mind shift I experienced at IED had a profound role in motivating me and enabling me to take up this challenging role\", he said.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We congratulate all these graduates on their appointment and wish them success in their efforts to improve the educational opportunities for children in their communities.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
